// Walled in on both sides, a boiler can't have its ash raked out: its grate counts as choked, the log says it needs
// room at one side, and coal fed in waits unlit (its water held on its top between the walls doesn't help it).
map
########################################
#......................................#
#......................................#
#......................................#
######......##.........................#
######......##.........................#
######wwwwww##.........................#
######wwwwww##.........................#
######wwwwww##.........................#
######......##.........................#
######......##.........................#
######......##.........................#
######......##.........................#
######......##......@..................#
########################################
########################################
end
give Boiler 1
place 2 -11 -2 Boiler
drop 10 Coal -11 -9
expect 3 boilers == 1
expect 300 bchoked == 1
expect 300 log:walled_in == 1
expect 300 bburning == 0
expect 300 bfuel == 1
